Number of even faces: 3, total even probability: 3*(2q) = 6q

Total probability: 3q + 6q = 9q = 1 ⇒ q = 1/9

Therefore, each odd face (1,3,5) has probability 1/9, each even face (2,4,6) has probability 2/9.

