So the only possible y is 4. Let me just verify again. If there are 4 rows of 8, that's 32 people. Then 46 - 32 = 14 people left, which would be 14 /7 = 2 rows of 7. So 2 rows of 7 and 4 rows of 8, total rows 6, total people 14 + 32 = 46. That works.

